      "writtenOn": "2026-07-03T12:21:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks a bit messy: `pkvm_setup_per_cpu()` has different semantics depending on debug vs non-debug mode (i.e. `base` is VA in debug mode but PA in non-debug more). Can\u0027t we pass `base` as VA in both modes?",
      "revId": "47cc62aa9583cf31c55083c60cd4f2f149d3df29",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
