      "writtenOn": "2026-07-06T11:07:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, makes sense.\n\nBut this seems a bit non-obvious, so maybe let\u0027s add a comment here like \"In debug mode, base is a virtual address used by the host kernel (which may be either direct map or vmalloc), not a physical address.\" ?",
